# Copy to `.npmrc` and fill in. `.npmrc` is gitignored and must never be
# committed - it is the file that ends up holding registry auth tokens.
#
# Almost all pnpm behaviour for this repo is configured in pnpm-workspace.yaml
# (catalog, catalogMode, minimumReleaseAge, allowBuilds, ...), not here. Keep
# this file for machine-local and credential settings only.

# --- Registry auth (CI sets these from secrets; do not hardcode tokens) ---
# //registry.npmjs.org/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}

# --- Machine-local overrides ---
# store-dir=/path/to/a/faster/disk/.pnpm-store
# network-concurrency=8
